IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg2-support`
IMPORT `dg2-powers`

-- Tests of dg2-powers.l4 (8 Del. C. sections 121 to 127). Expected values are written by hand from src:242 to src:292 of
-- de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, beside each assertion, before the run.

§ `Section 121`

-- src:243: granted by the chapter, another law or the certificate, or incidental to such a power; and necessary or convenient to the business or purposes.
#ASSERT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 121(a) the corporation, its officers, directors and stockholders possess and may exercise the power or privilege` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
-- src:244: every corporation is governed by the chapter.
#ASSERT `s 121(b) the corporation is governed by the provisions and subject to the restrictions and liabilities of this chapter` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(b) the corporation is governed by the provisions and subject to the restrictions and liabilities of this chapter` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 122`

-- (created under this chapter, certificate states a limited duration, participation in an association, participation in a transaction, the
-- corporation could conduct it by itself, the business is lawful, the board finds it in aid of governmental authority, the lending is for its
-- corporate purposes, the insurance is for its benefit, whose life, the stockholder-death purpose)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
      i IS A BOOLEAN
      j IS A `s 122(16) Whose life is insured`
      k IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 122 Facts about the power`
`a set of facts` a b c d e f g h i j k MEANS `s 122 Facts about the power` WITH
    `the corporation was created under this chapter` IS a
    `the certificate of incorporation states a limited period of duration` IS b
    `the participation is in a corporation, partnership, limited partnership, joint venture or other association of any kind` IS c
    `the participation is in a transaction, undertaking or arrangement` IS d
    `the participating corporation would have power to conduct the transaction, undertaking or arrangement by itself` IS e
    `the business is lawful` IS f
    `the board of directors finds the business to be in aid of governmental authority` IS g
    `the lending is for the corporation's corporate purposes` IS h
    `the insurance is for the corporation's benefit` IS i
    `whose life is insured` IS j
    `the insurance on the life of a stockholder is for the purpose of acquiring at the stockholder's death shares of the corporation's stock owned by the stockholder` IS k

`a corporation with nothing special` MEANS `a set of facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the life of a director, officer or employee of the corporation` FALSE

-- Powers held without condition (src:249 to 265), whether or not the certificate provides: here with the certificate stating a limited duration, which only paragraph (1) reads.
`a corporation whose certificate states a limited duration` MEANS `a set of facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the life of a director, officer or employee of the corporation` FALSE
