§ `Section 122(18)`

-- (made with stockholders in their capacity as such, minimum consideration met, contrary to the certificate, would be contrary to the laws if in the
-- certificate, a restriction relating to a specified action, the only reason it is contrary is a provision empowering the board)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 122(18) Facts about the contract`
`a stockholder contract` a b c d e f MEANS `s 122(18) Facts about the contract` WITH
    `the contract is made with 1 or more current or prospective stockholders, or 1 or more beneficial owners of stock, in its or their capacity as such` IS a
    `the consideration is at least the minimum consideration determined by the board of directors` IS b
    `the provision is contrary to the certificate of incorporation` IS c
    `the provision would be contrary to the laws of this State (other than section 115) if included in the certificate of incorporation` IS d
    `the provision is a restriction, prohibition or covenant that relates to a specified action` IS e
    `the only reason the provision is contrary is a provision of this title or of the certificate of incorporation that authorizes or empowers the board of directors (or any 1 or more directors) to take that action` IS f

#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract is one the corporation may make with stockholders` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 122(18) the contract is one the corporation may make with stockholders` (`a stockholder contract` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 122(18) the contract is one the corporation may make with stockholders` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- A provision contrary to neither: enforceable. Contrary to the certificate, or to the laws if it were in the certificate: not enforceable to that extent.
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Deemed not contrary: a restriction relating to a specified action, contrary only by reason of a provision empowering the board to take that action.
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not a contract under paragraph (18): not covered.
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` (`a stockholder contract` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation is subject to the remedies available under the law governing the contract` (`a stockholder contract` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation is subject to the remedies available under the law governing the contract` (`a stockholder contract` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation may agree to the undertaking` `to restrict or prohibit itself from taking actions specified in the contract` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation may agree to the undertaking` `to require the approval or consent of 1 or more persons or bodies before it may take actions specified in the contract` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation may agree to the undertaking` `to covenant that it or 1 or more persons or bodies will take, or refrain from taking, actions specified in the contract` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 122(18) the corporation may agree to the undertaking` `an undertaking of any other kind` EQUALS NOTHING

