#ASSERT NOT `s 125 the corporation has power to conduct a private business or trade school` FALSE

-- A law school corporation: (conducting a law school in Delaware, intends to meet ABA standards, the date it began actual operation, the date it
-- retained the dean, retained at its own expense, the dean is of an ABA-approved law school, chosen by the Attorney General from the panel,
-- the dean reported progress, a copy filed with the Secretary of Education and the Attorney General)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A DATE
      d IS A DATE
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
      i IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 125 Facts about a law school corporation`
`a law school corporation` a b c d e f g h i MEANS `s 125 Facts about a law school corporation` WITH
    `the corporation is conducting a law school which has its principal place of operation in Delaware` IS a
    `the corporation intends to meet the standards of approval of the American Bar Association` IS b
    `the date the corporation began actual operation` IS c
    `the date the corporation retained the dean` IS d
    `the corporation retained the dean at its own expense to make an on-site inspection and report` IS e
    `the dean or dean emeritus is of a law school fully approved by the American Bar Association` IS f
    `the dean was chosen by the Attorney General from a panel of 3 deans nominated one each by the trustees of the corporation, a committee of the Student Bar Association and a committee of lawyers who are parents of students, with 2 full professors of accredited law schools substituted for any dean a group could not find` IS g
    `the dean reported in writing that, in the dean's professional judgment, the corporation is attempting, in good faith, to comply with the standards for approval of the American Bar Association and is making reasonable progress toward meeting them` IS h
    `the corporation filed a copy of the report with the Secretary of Education and with the Attorney General` IS i

-- src:282: "not less than 1 year" in actual operation: 1 January 2024 to 1 January 2025 is a year; 31 December 2024 is not.
